  "name": "Witch Doctor Mojo Beam grows one branch per tick with no cap of 8 (#12847)",
  "contract": [
    "Mojo Beam 501117: 'Each time Mojo Beam heals a target it will grow a new branch. Each new branch immediately",
    "heals and continues healing.' Live (combat log 2026-08-31, one raid Witch Doctor, 32 beams, aggregates) the",
    "healed targets grew by about one per 500 ms tick (median 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 at 0.5 to 3 s, 15 at 8 s, up to",
    "17), with no cap of 8. The tick script let every branch grow one, doubling to a cap of 8. Contributor",
    "decision 2026-11-23 (class ADR witch-doctor/0034): one new branch per tick, no cap. Seven grouped Warlocks",
    "(a raid) and their Imps stand within 15 yd of each other and 19 to 28 yd from the Witch Doctor, who is out of",
    "their 15 yd reach: 14 units a branch can take. The mana is refilled every 250 ms (a precondition fixture, the",
    "drain is judged by 501117 beam_drain). Expected: 2, 3, 4 and 5 heals on ticks 1 to 4 (9 at 1750 ms and 14 at",
    "2250 ms; doubling reads 14 at 1750 ms), the channel still running at 2250 ms (the per-branch drain of 8",
    "branches, 1643 on tick 4, is more than the 1497 refill and interrupts it), every Warlock and Imp healed and 146",
    "heals over the 16 ticks (doubling heals 8 units)."
  ],
